1
00:00:00,430 --> 00:00:03,140
This is two hundred and thirty
years of American history,

2
00:00:03,190 --> 00:00:04,625
on one line.

3
00:00:04,825 --> 00:00:08,625
Watch. Past the wars, past
the decades, into one summer,

4
00:00:08,675 --> 00:00:10,380
one week, one night.

5
00:00:10,610 --> 00:00:16,380
At 20:17:40 UTC, the Eagle lands.
Six and a half hours later,

6
00:00:16,430 --> 00:00:17,787
the first step.

7
00:00:18,117 --> 00:00:21,367
Every moment on one line,
exact to the second.

8
00:00:21,417 --> 00:00:23,736
That's OpenChronology, and it's free.
